<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Sagala Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">VALUMI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluva ya Mutumi Pawulo kwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Valumi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lum</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluva ya mutumi Pawulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">VALUMI</para>
  <para style="imt">Wulongolo</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndongwa tsotsili mu chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chino cha Valumi chifuluche chive chandikwe na mutumi Pawulo hagati ha mwaka gwa 54 na mwaka gwa 58 luhuma fyo avaga kuleleka Yesu Chilisito. Mbaka luvala ulo Pawulo avaga ang'ali kufika ku inyi ya Lumi, ihyo avatumye baluva yino ili kuvalajitsa vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito va uko ku Lumi wo vavaga Vayahudi na wosi Vayawudi. Akandiche baluva yino ho avaga ku muji gwa Kolindo, hono ho ikalaga luvala ulo. Pawulo akandiche baluva yino, kwa kugana kuta, vanu wo si Vayawudi vamutumbe na kumuhulikitsa Yesu Chilisito, ndongwa itso tsili mu sula ya 16:26.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chino cha Valumi chin'tanga ndalahela vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito va chila hono na luvala lweka, kwasawuli Pawulo adadambwe finofu hila fyo atsitselye ndongwa tsa wukuluso wo tufuluche tuwupate kukolela kwa Yesu Chilisito. Kaha Pawulo akahantsitse Ndongwa Nofu tsa Yesu Chilisito na Lilagano lya Katali. Vanu wolofu wo vasomile, vantumba kuta musitali go gwitwisile ndongwa tseka tsa chitabu chino, go gula go guli musula ya 1:16 go gunlonga kuta, “Kwasawuli sinambe ntsiyiwonele nyoni Ndongwa Nofu ya Yesu Chilisito, kwasawuli iyo yo wuvetso wa Mulungu wo wunleta wukuluso kwa chila munu yo angitumba, kwa Vayawudi tandi na kaha kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi.” Hono ha kwantsa ha chitabu chino cha Valumi, mu sula ya 1-12 muna ndongwa ngomi tsa mugati ndalahela tsa kumutsela Mulungu, na hono ha kavili ha chitabu chino mu sula ya 13-15 mogali malajitso molofu go gan'ganika kuditwa na vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndongwa tsotsili mu chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="io">Pawulo ankwantsa kwandika baluva yake kota baluva tsinji fyo tsandikwaga kwa kitambutsa mwene, na kuvatambula vala wo anguvandichila mu sula ya 1:1-15.</para>
  <para style="io">Ankwandika hila fyo ali munu munya ndongwa ntsibi, na fyo afuluche akuluche kukolela kwa Yesu Chilisito mu sula ya 1:16-11:36.</para>
  <para style="io">Hihilaga Pawulo ankwandika ndongwa tso tsin'ganika kuditwa na vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito mu sula ya 12:1-15:13.</para>
  <para style="io">Pawulo ansinda kwandika baluva yino ya Valumi kwa kuvasamusa vanu vatunga wo vavaga mugati mwa vanu va Chilisito va ku inyi ya Lumi mu sula ya 16.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Heni Pawulo mutantsi va Yesu Chilisito, na mutumi yo mbagulwe na kuchemwa kwasawuli ya kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Ndongwa Nofu tsila tso Mulungu avalonje vanu kuta akuvapela na avaga alongwe kutsivikula mu Mandiko gake kukolela kwa valoli vake. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Itso tso Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mwana va Mulungu, Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito, kwa kuleleka kwake kuto mun u, avaga lulelo lwa Dawudi, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />na kaha kwa wuvetso wa Muhe va Mulungu mwanga akalajilwe kuta Mwana va Mulungu kwa kutsilipulwa, nayo yo Yesu Chilisito Mutwa vetu. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Kukolela kwa uyo Yesu, Mulungu amelye wuwuya ntsive mutumi na kuvalongotsa vanu va inyi tseka, ili vamutumbe na kumuhulikitsa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Henye nyeka muli vamwe va vanu wo vachemilwe na Mulungu ili muve vanu vake Yesu Chilisito.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Heni mutumi Pawulo yo ntsandiche baluva yino, wo mun'ganwa na Mulungu ndalahela na wo muchemilwe muve vahagulwa vake. Ntsinguvasuchila kuta wuwuya na wusichimafu wo wunhuma kwa Mulungu Dada vetu na kwa Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito wuvaje hamwe na henye.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Suko na kumulumba Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Kulutila fyeka, ntsin'gana ndongole kumulumba Mulungu vangu kukolela kwa Yesu Chilisito kwasawuli ya henye nyeka na kwasawuli ya litumbilo lyenu lyo linvikulwa mu inyi tseka. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Mulungu yo ntsingumutumichila kwa numbula yangu yeka kwa kutsivikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mwanange, mwene yo an'tsela ntsinlonga wukweli kuta ntsinguviwuka lwa hihyo mu suko tsangu. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Ntsingumusuka angavile mbetse kutsa kwa henye. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Ntsingiwiniwa ndalahela kuvawona ili ntsivatanje mupata fifunje fya Muhe va Mulungu ili mukangatswe mu litumbilo lyenyu. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Kulutila ihyo, henye na heni twikangatse mu litumbilo lya Yesu Chilisito. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Vang'olotsangu ntsin'gana mutsele kuta, mala ntsongofu ntsaganaga kutsa kwa henye, lechelelo mbaka sambi ndemitswe. Ntsitse kwa henye ili ntsivakweje vanu vamutumbye Chilisito, kota hila fyo ngadisile kwa vanu vanji wosi Vayawudi. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Heni ntsin'ganika kuvavikulila vanu veka, kwa Vajilichi na kwa wosi Vajilichi, na kaha ntsin'ganika kwa vanu vanya ntselo na wo valihela ntselo. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Ihyo ntsili chang'ani kutsivikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Chilisito kwa henye yo muli ku Lumi.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wuvetso wa Ndongwa Nofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Heni sinambe ntsitsiwonele nyoni kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Chilisito, kwasawuli itso tso wuvetso wa Mulungu tso tsin'leta wukulusi kwa chila munu yo angutsitumba, kwa Muyawudi tandi na kaha kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Kwasawuli lulongwa Lunofu lwa Mulungu lulajilaga bila kifiha hila fyo tun'ganika tuve ili tudichilwe halutalo ha Mulungu, lulongwa ulu luditwaga kwa litumbilo kuhuma hamutalo mbaka hawudugo. Kota fyo yandikwe kuta, “Munu muwuya akikala kwa litumbilo.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongwa ntsibi tsa vanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Mbipo ya Mulungu kuhuma Kilanga yiwonekaga kwa vanu veka wo van'dita ndongwa ntsibi na wubi weka wo wuli tebe na mwene, nawo vankwambutsa vanu valeche kuwutsela wukweli wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Kwasawuli chila munu anguwutsela wukweli wa Mulungu hila fyo wuli, kwasawuli Mulungu mwanga avalaje lulongwa ulo. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Luhuma hala Mulungu ho awumbite inyi, wula wuvetso wake wa siku tseka tsotsigaya wudugo na mwene fyo ali Mulungu, na yivaje sinambe wuwoneche kwa miho wuwonekaga bila kifiha, nawo vanu vafuluche vatsele ndongwa tseka kukolela kwa finu fyo awumbite. Ihyo vanu valihela lulongwa lwa kipamanila. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Nayivaje vanu iwo van'tsela kuta kuna Mulungu, lechelelo sinambe vamufugamile kota fyo yin'ganika na kumulumba, mahotso gawo gaveye mabi na sinambe vatselewe ndongwa tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Vangidutsa kuta vana nyala kumbe vapuva hela, <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />vanleka kumufugamila Mulungu yo mumi siku tseka tso tsigaya wudugo kwa minu jojihongulwe na kuhwanitsa na munu yo afwaga, awu mideje, awu minyama, awu finu fyo finkwava.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Ihyo Mulungu akavalekaje valongotswe na mbwiniwo tsawo tsibi tsa numbula tsawo ili viditile waafu na kibedalana mu mivili jawo. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Vakagalulaje wukweli wa Mulungu wuve wudesi na kufugamila finu fyo awumbite Mulungu na kuleka kumufugamila Mulungu yo an'ganika kufugamilwa siku tseka tso tsigaya wudugo. Eena!<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Ihyo Mulungu akavalekaje vafwate mbwimiwo tsawo tsibi. Nambe vadala vawo vakabadilasaje ntsovelo tsa mivili jawo tsa kuva na valume vawo, na kuditilana vene kwa vene. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Nawo Valume vakaditaje hihyo, vakalekaje ntsovelo tsa kuva na mulume na mudala, vakiwiniwaje vene kwa vene. Valume vakaditaje ndongwa tsa kuhonga nyoni na valume vayawo, nawo vakatowaje kota fyo yin'ganika kwasawuli ya ndongwa tsawo ntsibi.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Kota hila fyo valemile kumutsela Mulungu nayo Mulungu avalesile mu mbwiniwo tsawo ntsibi, nawo vakaditaje ndongwa tso sitsaganikaga kuditwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Vavaga na wubi wa chila ayina, kaha vavaga na waafu, na mbwiniwo tsa ndongwa ntsibi, mahotso mabi na mbafya, na wukopolaji, wudesi, chitika na wuhehi, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />na wudeteletsi, wo vangumuvipila Mulungu, vanya chitika, na vanya kidutsa, na vanya kikangatsa kudita ndongwa ntsibi, na wosi nambe vavahulikitse valeli vawo, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />vapuva, wo valihela litumbilo na wo valihela lusungu. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Nayivaje vangugatsela malajitso ga Mulungu kuta vanu wo van'dita ndongwa kota itso van'ganika kukopolwa. Kulutila ihyo, siyo kuta vankwendelela kudita ndongwa itso ng'ani ila vanguvatsumila na vala wo van'dita itso.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Nyigo ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Ihyo manyi unguvahiga vanu vanji na heve un'dita ndongwa tsitso tso van'dita siufuluche wipamane, kwasawuli hila fyo unguvahiga vanu vanji kwa lulongwa loluve na heve mwene ungihiga. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Hetwe tun'tsela kuta Mulungu avahigaga kota fyo yin'ganika vanu vala wo van'dita ndongwa kota itso. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Mbe, heve munu yo unhiga ndongwa itso na heve un'dita ndongwa kota tsitso, unhotsa kuta ufuluche utyeje nyigo ya Mulungu? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Awu unguwubedala wuwuya wake wukomi na lusungu lwake na kutsinda kwake, kuno sinambe utsele kuta uwo wuwuya wake wun'gana wukulongotse uleche ndongwa ntsibi na kumupituchila mwene? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Lechelelo kwasawuli ya wukangafu wa numbula yako yoyilema kuleka ndongwa ntsibi na kumupituchila Mulungu, ungivichila achiba ya chitowo cha siku yila ya mbipo ya Mulungu yo chila munu akumuwona fyo anguvahiga vanu kwa wuwuya. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Siku iyo Mulungu akumuhomba chila munu hihila kota fyotsili ng'olwa tsake. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Vanu vala wo vangikatsa kwa kutsidita ndongwa nofu, vansaka wumelemo na hesima na wumi wosi wukwananjika, kaha Mulungu akuvapela wumi wo wugaya wudugo. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Lechelelo kwa vanu vala wo vansaka ndongwa tsawo vene na vala wo vanguwulema wukweli kwa kufwata ndongwa tsawo ntsibi, iwo Mulungu akuvavipila na kuvahiga. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Kukuva na ng'odeko na ng'ung'uto kwa chila munu yo an'dita ndongwa ntsibi, akulongola Muyawudi na kaha vanu vala wosi Vayawudi. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Lechelelo Mulungu akumupela chila munu yo an'dita ndongwa nofu akuvadita vatsumitswe na vanu na kuhesimilwa na vakuva na wusichimafu, kwa Muyawudi tandi na kwa wosi Vayawudi. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Kwasawuli Mulungu siamuhigaga munu yoyuve kwa wuvagu.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Vanu veka wosi Vayawudi wo van'dita ndongwa ntsibi kuno si vagatsele malajitso ga Musa go apelitwe na Mulungu, vakwananjika navavaje sivagatsele malajitso ga Musa. Nawo Vayawudi vala wo van'dita ndongwa ntsibi kuno vangugatsela malajitso ga Musa go apelitwe na Mulungu, vakuhigwa kwa malajitso ga Musa. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Siyo vanu vala wo vanhulika malajitso wo van'valilwa wuwuya kwa Mulungu. Lechelelo wo van'valilwa wuwuya wo vala wo vanhulika na wovan'dita kota hila majitso fyo gan'gana. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Enaa! Muhotse tandi kwa vanu vala wosi Vayawudi wo sivapelitwe malajitso ga Musa, lechelelo hovangugadita malajitso igo kwa kulongotswa na numbula tsawo, vene vankuva malajitso nayivaje si vagatsele malajitso igo. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Iwo vanlajila kuta gala go gan'ganika mu malajitso igo gandikwe mu numbula tsawo. Numbula tsawo tsinlajila na mahotso gawo gansumana na kuvahiga awu kuvapamanila. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Ihyo kota hila fyo ntsavavikulye Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu, ndongwa itsi tsikuhumila siku yila Mulungu ho akutsihiga fiho tsa vanu kwa kukolela kwa Yesu Chilisito.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayawudi na Malajitso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Heve yo ungichema kuta uli Muyawudi na kihuvila malajitso ga Musa go apelitwe na Mulungu na kidutsa kuta heve uli munu va Mulungu, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />kaha ungutsitsela ndongwa nofu tso angutsigana Mulungu, na widahitse kwa malajitso ga Musa kuta ufuluche uhime na kuhagula kudita ndongwa tso angutsigana Mulungu, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />na un'tsela nachene kuta heve uli chilongotsi va fibofu na heve yo uli tala ya vanu wo vali mujitsa, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />na heve unhotsa kuta ufuluche uvalongotse vanu vapufi na kuvadahitsa vanu wo vankwantsa kidahitsa wukweli wa litumbilo, kwasawuli heve una nyala na un'tsela wukweli wa chila chinu chochili mu malajitso igo ga Musa. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Lelo heve yo unguvadahitsa vanu vanji, mbona ulema kidahitsa? Heve yo unguvadahitsa kuta “Alahogola munu kuhitsa,” Mbona heve mwene unhitsa? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Heve yo unlonga “Alahogola munu kuva mwaafu,” Mbona heve mwene un'dita waafu? Heve yo unvipila mihoka ja kuhongolwa, mbona heve mwene un'hitsa finu mu nyumba tsa mihoka ijo? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Mbe! Heve yo ungidutsa kwasawuli ya malajitso, lechelelo ungumubedala Mulungu kwa kudita finji na malajitso gage? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Kota hila fyo yandikwe mu mandiko ga Mulungu kuta, “Vanu va inyi tsinji vangumuliga Mulungu kwasawuli ya heve Muyawudi.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Kwinjila likumbi kwa munu yula yo sinambe ahulikitse malajitso kukuva na mana yachi manyi an'telana na malajitso igo, nalyo likumbi lyake lifuluche lifwaye chinu chachi? <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Ino lelo manyi vala wo sivinje likumbi van'dita kota hila fyo gan'gana malajitso, mbe sivafuluche vavalilwe kuta vinje likumbi? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Ihyo kwa munu yula yosi inje likumbi va inyi yinji yo angugadita malajitso, akuleka ndawuli kukuhiga heve Muyawudi yo winje likumbi na wanuche mandiko na kugatsela malajitso ga Mulungu ndalahela kuno un'dita finji? <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Munu si afuluche ave Muyawudi nachene kwa hila fyo anwoneka hela, na likumbi lya wukweli si chinu cha mwivala hela awu cha muvili hela. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Lechelelo munu ankuva Muyawudi hila fyo ali mugati na likumbi lya wukweli linkuva lya mu numbula siyo mumuvili ndaya. Munu kota uyo siafuluche atsumilwe na vanu, lechelelo munu uyo adichilwaga na Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Mbe, Muyawudi avalutye chinu chachi vanu wosi Vayawudi? Nako kwinjila likumbi kuna mana yachi? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Wukweli kuta, kuva Muyawudi kuna fwayida ntsolofu, kwasawuli kwantsa Vayawudi vanuche wujumbe kuhuma kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Ino lelo yika kuva ndawuli manyi Vayawudi vanji vave si vamutumbye Mulungu? Mbe, kwa kuleka kumutumba vafuluche vamudite Mulungu aleche kuhuvilwa? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Ndaya nye, Mulungu akusigala kuva va kihuvilwa siku tseka nayivaje vanu vadetaga. Kota hila mandiko gake fyo ganlonga kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">“Chila luvala heve ulongaga wukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">na mu wuhigo heve usumaga.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Lechelelo manyi wubi wetu wunlajila kuta Mulungu an'dita muwuya, lelo tukulonga chinu chachi? Mbe, manyi Mulungu atutove hetwe ankuva si an'dita hachi? Ntsinlonga kota munu hela. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Ndaya vayawe! Manyi Mulungu alihela hachi, afuluche ayihije inyi chinya ndawuli?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Vanu vafuluche valonje kuta manyi ntsive sinambe ndite chila cho an'gana Mulungu na kufuluche kumulajila Mulungu kwa vanu vanji kuta ana hachi na vamutsumitse, lelo kwasawuli ya chichi tunhingwa kuta tuna ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Lelo manyi ndongwa tsive ihyo tufuluche tulonje kota vanu vanji fyo vangutudeteletsela kuta tun'dahitsa hihyo, “Tudite ndongwa ntsibi ili tupate ndongwa nofu!” Iwo wo vanloga ihyo vakuhigwa kota fyo yin'ganika.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu veka vadisile ndongwa ntsibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Ino lelo tulonje chinu chachi? Mbe, hetwe Vayawudi tuli vawuya kulutila vanu vanji? Ndaya, kwasawuli mwanga tulongwe kulonga kuta Vayawudi na vanu veka wosi Vayawudi van'tavalwa na ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Kota hila mandiko ga Mulungu fyo gandikwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">Kuduhuli nambe munu yumwe yo an'dita kota hila fyo agana Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Kuduhuli nambe munu yumwe munya ntselo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">kuduhuli nambe munu yumwe yo angumusaka Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Vanu veka vamulesile Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">vanu veka vakosise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">kuduhuli nambe munu yumwe yo an'dita ndongwa tso an'gana Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Mikolomelo jawo jina kota makabuli gogali mwatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">na milimi jawo jilongaga wudesi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">Mumilomo jawo tsinhuma ndongwa tso tsinakota sumu ya ntsoka.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Milomo jawo jinlonga ndongwa tsa kukotola na ndongwa tsa kwambutsa wusungu kwa vanu vanji.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Vanu iwo vapefu kubilimila kukopola vanu,<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />hono hohave hovam'bita vambutsaga wananjifu na ng'odeko kwa vanu,<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />sinambevatsele kwikala na vanu kwa wusichimafu.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Sinambevamuhesimile Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Lelo tun'tsela kuta ndongwa tseka tso tsinlongwa mu malajitso ga Musa, tsivalonjelaga vala wo vanlongotswa na malajitso igo, ili valeche kuva na chinu chochive cha kipamanila, na inyi yeka yive hanyi ha wuhigo wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Kwasawuli kuduhuli munu yo yuve yo akuvalilwa wuwuya na Mulungu kwa kudita ndongwa tsa malajitso ga Musa, kwasawuli malajitso igo gaditaga hela tutsele ndongwa ntsibi.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudichilwa na Mulungu kwa kutumbila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Lechelelo sambi ng'asi ya Mulungu ya kuvadichila vanu kuva vawuya halutalo hake yiwoniche bila kuhuvila malajitso, kota hila malajitso ga Musa na valoli va Mulungu mwanga valongwe kulonga lulongwa ulu. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Nayo yo yakumutumbila Yesu Chilisito, Mulungu avadichilaga vanu kuva na vawuya na si abagulaga munu yoyuve, <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />kwasawuli vanu veka vadisile ndongwa ntsibi na kugaya kuhesimilwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Vanvalilwa vawuya halutalo ha Mulungu kwa kugombolwa kwa lusungu lugaya wuhombo na Yesu Chilisito. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Mulungu amutawe Yesu, ili kwa danda yake ave ng'asi ya kuvahetsela vanu ndongwa tsawo ntsibi kwa litumbilo lyawo kwa Yesu, Mulungu akadisile ihyo ili alajile wuwuya wake. Kwasawuli iho hamutalo Mulungu ikangitse na siatsihotsaga ndongwa ntsibi tsa vanu, <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />lelo luvala ulu Mulungu an'dita ihyo ili ayilajile wuwuya wake, ili mwene ave na muwuya na kudichilwa na mwene munu yula yo akumutumbila Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Ino lelo tufuluche twidutse kwa chinu chachi? Kuduhuli! Mbe, kwasawuli ya kudita malajitso? Ndaya, ila tungitsa kwasawuli ya kumutumbila Yesu ng'ani. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Tun'tijila kuta Mulungu amudichilaga munu kuva muwuya halutalo hake kwa kumutumbila Yesu na siyo kwa kudita kota fyo gan'gana malajitso. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Mbe, Mulungu va Vayawudi ng'ani? Awu yo Mulungu va vanu wosi Vayawudi? Eena! Mulungu yo Mulungu va Vayawudi na vanu wosi Vayawudi. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Mulungu yo yumwe hela, nayo yo akuvadita Vayawudi vave na vawuya halutalo hake kwa litumbilo lyawo, na yo akuvadita vanu wosi Vayawudi vave vawuya halutalo hake kwa litumbilo lyawo. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Mbe, kwa litumbilo ilyo tukuva tungugalema malajitso? Ndaya! Lechelelo manyi tumutumbe Yesu tunkuva tungugadichila malajitso fyo ganloga.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Lelo tulonje chichi kwasawuli ya dada vetu Ibulahimu chinya muvili, nayo atselite ndawuli lulongwa ulu lwa kidichilwa halutalo ha Mulungu? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Manyi kota Ibulahimu akadichilwe kuva muwuya halutalo ha Mulungu kwasawuli ya ng'olwa tsake, duve afuluche idutse halutalo ha Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Kwasawuli mandiko ga Mulungu ganlonga hino, “Ibulahimu avaga amutumbye Mulungu, nayo akadichilwaje kuva muwuya halutalo ha Mulungu.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Munu yo aditaga katsi ahobwaga, mahombo gake siyo chifunje ndaya, ila yo hachi yache. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Lechelelo munu yo sinambe ihuvile ng'olwa tsake, ila angumutumbila Mulungu yo avahulumilaga vanu wo van'dita ndongwa ntsibi, Mulungu alidichilaga litumbilo lyake munu uyo na kumudita ave muyuya halutalo hake. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Kaha nayo Dawudi alontsile hihyo hala ho alongaga ndongwa tsa wusangalo wa munu yo adichilwe na Mulungu, bila kulava ng'olwa tso an'dita.<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Vakusangalala vanu vala wo vahulumilwe ndongwa tsawo ntsibi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">wo ndongwa tsawo ntsibi tsifutitwe.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Akusangalala nachene munu yula yo Mutwa sinambe atsiwuche ndongwa tsake ntsibi.”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Mbe, lulongwa ulo lwa kusangalala lo alontsile Dawudi luli kwa vanu wo vinje likumbi ng'ani, awu na kwa vanu wo sivinje likumbi? Eena, kaha na kwa vanu wo sivinje likumbi kwasawuli mwanga tulontsile, “Ibulahimu avaga na litumbilo, nayo Mulungu akamudichilaje kuva muwuya halutalo hake.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Ihyo Ibulahimu akidichilwe na Mulungu hanili? Hoavaga inje likumbi awu hoavaga ang'ali kwinjila likumbi? Mulungu amudiche Ibulahimu hoavaga ang'ali kwinjila likumbi. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Hambele Ibulahimu inje likumbi ili yiwoneche kuta Mulungu amudiche kuta muwuya halutalo hake, kwasawuli ya litumbilo lyake lyo avaga nalyo ho avaga ang'ali kwinjila likumbi. Ihyo Ibulahimu aveye dada va vanu veka vanya litumbilo wo sinambe vinjile likumbi kota fyo avaga Ibulahimu, nayo Mulungu akuvadichila kwa kwasawuli ya litumbilo lyawo. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Ihyo Ibulahimu yo dada va vanu wo vinje likumbi, lechelelo siyo kwasawuli vinje likumbi! Ila kwasawuli vitumbye kota fyo avaga itumbye dada vetu Ibulahimu ho avaga ang'acha kwinjila likumbi.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chila cho alontsile Mulungu kuta akutupela chanuchilwaga kwa kitumbila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Mulungu avaga amulonje Ibulahimu hamwe na chilelo chake kuta akuvapela inyi yeka yive yawo. Alontsile ihyo siyo kwasawuli Ibulahimu avaga an'dita malajitso ga Musa go apelitwe na Mulungu, lechelelo kwasawuli avaga amutumbye Mulungu, ihyo akadichilwaje kuva muwuya. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Kwasawuli manyi wo vakupelwa ifyo fyo alontsile Mulungu vakuva vala ng'ani wo vanlongotswa na malajitso igo, lelo litumbilo ilyo likuva lya chichi? Nacho cho alontsile Mulungu chikuva si chinu ndaya. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Malajitso ga Musa gambutsaga mbipo ya Mulungu. Lechelelo hono ho halihela malajitso ga Musa, si ufuluche ubite tebe na malajitso igo.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Kwasawuli iyo lulongwa ulu luhumilaga kwa kitumbila, ihyo lelo chila cho alontsile Mulungu kuta akuvapela vakwanuchila kwa wuwuya wa Mulungu, na kuta nachene lulongwa ulo luli kwa vanu veka na siyo kwa vala ng'ani wo vangugahulikitsa malajitso ga Musa, ila kaha na kwa vala veka wo vangikala kwa kitumbila kota fyo avaga Ibulahimu. Kwasawuli mwene Ibulahimu yo dada vetu hetwe tweka. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Kota fyo yandikwe mu mandiko ga Mulungu, “Nguvisile heve uve dada va vanu va inyi ntsolofu.” Lulongwa ulo lwa wukweli, kwasawuli Mulungu yula yo Ibulahimu amutumbye, uyo yo avapelaga wumi vanu wo vafweye na kwa wuvetso wake finu fyo fyavaga filikuduhu finkuva. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ibulahimu ali amutumbye Mulungu na yivaje hila fyo ali, lwavaga lutalamu kuluhuvila lulongwa ulo. Icho cho chambutso cha kuditwa kuva dada va vanu va inyi ntsolofu, kota Mandiko ga Mulungu fyo ganlonga, “Ukuva na lulelo lolofu kota nyenyetsi.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Ibulahimu avaga mugogolo na avaga kota na myaka myaa hino hala Mulungu ho amutumbitse lulongwa ulo, na yivaje myaka ja kupata mwana javaga mwanga jilutye na muvili gwake gwavaga kota gufweye, lechelelo mwene Ibulahimu endelye kumutumbila Mulungu. Nayo mudala vake Sala avaga mende. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Ibulahimu siavaga na muhwehwe goguve na Mulungu kwa chila cho avaga amutumbitse kuta akumuditila, lechelelo akatsindilaje kuno itumbye na angumutsumitsa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Atselaga kuta Mulungu akudita chila cho avaga amulonje kuta akumupela. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Icho cho chambutso cha Mulungu kumudichila Ibulahimu kuta muwuya. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Lelo kwa lulongwa luno kuta, “Mulungu amudiche Ibulahimu kuta muwuya,” siyavaga kwasawuli ya mwene Ibulahimu ng'ani. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Ila hihila na lulongwa luno lunkuva na kwa hetwe wo tungumutumbila Mulungu yo amutsilipwe Mutwa vetu Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Mulungu amutawe Yesu akopolwe kwasawuli ya ndongwa tsetu ntsibi na kaha akamutsilipulaje ili hetwe tudichilwe kuva vawuya.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Kuva na wusichimafu na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Kwakuva mwanga tudisilwe vawuya kwa kumutumbila Mulungu, ihyo tunawo wusichimafu na Mulungu kukolela kwa Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Kwa kumutumbila Yesu, Mulungu atupelye wuwuya wake, nambe sambi tungikala mu wuwuya uwo, tunsangalala hilo kwasawuli tuna lihuvilo. Ihyo duve tuna luhuvi lwa kihantsa na Mulungu mu wumelemo wake. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Si ihyo hela, kaha tun'sangalala na mu ng'odeko kwasawuli tuntsela kuta ng'odeko tsiletaga wukangatso, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />nawo wukangatso wutuditaga tuleche kuva na muloto na uko kuleka kuva na muloto kutuditaga tuve na lihuvilo. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Lihuvilo ilyo silifuluche litudite tugotsole! Kwakuva Mulungu mwanga avisile wugano wake mu numbula tsetu kukolela kwa Muhe vake yo atupelye.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Hotwavaga tung'acha tunlemwa kikulusa tuvene, hala luvala holwavaga kukwila Chilisito akafyaje kwasawuli ya hetwe wo tu vanya ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Siyo lulongwa lupefu kwa munu kufwa kwasawuli ya munu munya wuwuya, ila munu afuluche ajele kufwa kwasawuli ya munu munofu. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Lechelelo Mulungu atulaje kuta angutugana, luvala lula ho twavaga tung'acha tuvanya ndongwa ntsibi, Chilisito akafwaje kwasawuli ya hetwe. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Duve, sambi tudisilwe kuva vawuya halutalo ha Mulungu kwa danda ya Chilisito, ihyo kukolela kwa mwene Chilisito akutukulusa na mbipo ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Hala ho twavaga tung'acha tuntelana na Mulungu akatuhetselaje wula wutelani kwa chifo cha Mwanage. Ihyo sambi tupatine na Mulungu na tun'tsela nachene kuta tukukuluswa kwa wumi wake. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Lechelelo kulutila ifyo fyeka, tuna wusangalo kukolela kwa Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito yo atudisile tupatane na Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Kukolela kwa munu yumwe ndongwa ntsibi tsikinjilaje mu inyi, natso tsikambutsaje chifo. Ihyo chifo chikatagalilaje kwa vanu veka, kwasawuli vanu veka vadisile ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Kwasawuli malajitso ga Musa hogavaga gang'ali kutsa, ndongwa ntsibi mwanga tsavaga kotsili. Nambe ihyo ndongwa ntsibi sitsivalilwaga manyi kuve kuduhu malajitso igo. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Nambe ihyo, luhuma chipindi cha Adamu mbaka chipindi cha Musa, chifo chikatagalilaje kwa vanu veka, mbaka kwa vanu vala wosi vadisile ndongwa ntsibi kota hila fyo adisile Adamu hala ho alemile kumuhulikitsa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Adamu avaga muhwano gwa Chilisito yo atsitse hambele. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Lechelelo lulongwa lubi lo aludisile Adamu silufuluche lwihwane na lusungu lwa Mulungu. Nayivaje kwa lulongwa lubi lwa munu yumwe lukambutsaje chifo kwa vanu veka, ho hihyo kwa wuwuya wa munu yumwe yo Yesu Chilisito, Mulungu akalutitsaje lusungu na chifunje chake kwa vanu wolofu. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Kanji kuna wulekanifu hagati ha chifunje cha Mulungu na lulongwa lubi lwa munu yumwe yo Adamu. Kwasawuli Mulungu akahitsile chila cho adisile munu yumwe, lechelelo kwasawuli ya ndongwa ntsibi tsa vanu wolofu, Mulungu akavapelaje chifunje chake cha kuvadita vanu vave vawuya halutalo hake. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Wukweli kwa kukolela lulongwa lubi lwa munu yumwe, chifo chikatagalilaje kwa vanu veka kwasawuli ya munu uyo. Lechelelo nachene chinu cho adisile yula munu yumwe Yesu Chilisito chinofu ndalahela, vanu veka wo vankwanuchila lusungu ulo lwa Mulungu na chifunje chake cha kuva vawuya halutalo ha Mulungu, nawo vakutavala mu wumi kukolela kwa munu yumwe yo Yesu Chilisito.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Enaa, kota hila lulongwa lubi lwa munu yumwe lukaletaje wuhigo wa chifo cha vanu veka, ho hihyo kwa wuwuya wa munu yumwe vanu veka vampata wumi na kidichilwa halutalo ha Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Kaha kota hila kwa munu yumwe fyo alemile kuhulikitsa, vanu wolofu vakaditwaje vanya ndongwa ntsibi. Hohihyo kwa kuhulikitsa kwa munu yumwe, vanu wolofu vakuditwa vave vawuya halutalo ha Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Malajitso ga Musa hogavaga kutsa gakambutsaje ndongwa ntsibi tsive ntsolofu, lechelelo hala ndongwa ntsibi hotsavaga kulutila kuva ntsolofu nalo lusungu lwa Mulungu lukalutilaje ndalahela. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Kota hila ndongwa ntsibi fyo tsikambutse chifo kwa chila munu, ho hihyo na lusungu lwa Mulungu lun'tavala kwa kuvadita vanu vave vawuya na kuvaletela wumi wugaya wudugo kukolela kwa Chilisito Yesu Mutwa vetu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Kufwa mu ndongwa ntsibi na kutsilipuka hamwe na Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Ino lelo tulonje chinu chachi? Twendelele kikala mu ndongwa ntsibi ili lusungu lwa Mulungu lulutile kuva lolofu? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Ndaya bee! Hetwe yo tutsifwilye ndongwa ntsibi, chinya ndawuli kaha twikale mu ndongwa ntsibi? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Mbe! Siun'tsela kuta hetwe tweka yo tumutumbye Chilisito Yesu, twabatitswe na kihantsa na mwene kwa chifo chake? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Ihyo tukafweye na kutsikwa hamwe nayo kukolela mu wubatitso wake na chifo chake, ili kota hila Chilisito fyo atsilipulwe kwa wuvina wa Dada, ho ihyo na hetwe natwe tuvetse kikala mu wumi wupya. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Ihyo manyi hetwe twihantsitse na mwene kwa chifo chake, ho hihyo tukihantsa nayo mu wutsilipuko wake. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Tun'tsela kuta wunu wetu wa katali wavambitwe na kufwa mu musalaba hamwe na Chilisito, ili ludali lwa ndongwa ntsibi lwananjiche, tuleche kuva kaha tuvapogotsi va ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Kwasawuli ho tunkuva tufweye kota ihyo, tunkuva tuwopwiche nachene kuhuma mu ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Lelo manyi tufweye hamwe na Chilisito, tuna litumbilo kuta kaha tukikala hamwe na mwene. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Tun'tsela kuta Chilisito mwanga atsilipulwe na siafuluche afwe kaha, ihyo siakufwa kanji. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Ihyo Chilisito afweye mala kamwe hela na ndongwa ntsibi tsilihela ludali kanji kwake. Na sambi ali mumi na mu wumi uwo an'dita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Ho hihyo na henye mun'ganika mwiwone kuta munakota mufweye kuhuma mu ndongwa ntsibi, lechelelo kota yo mungikala mu wumwe na Mulungu kwa kumutumba Chilisito Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Ihyo lelo mulekaje kutsilechela ndongwa ntsibi tsilongotse mivili jenyu jo jikufwa, kaha mulekaje kutsidichila mbwiniwo tsake. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Mulekaje kuchitawula nambe chilungo chimwe cha mivili jenyu chive cha kuditila ndongwa ntsibi. Lechelelo mwitawule henye kwa Mulungu kota vanu wo vatsilipulwe kuhuma mu chifo, lelo sambi mwitawule na kudita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Ndongwa ntsibi sitsifuluche tsivatavale henye kahi, kwakuva si munlongotswa na malajitso ga Musa, ila munlongotswa na lusungu lwa Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vapogotsi wo vadita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Mbe, sambi tulonje chichi? Tudite ndongwa ntsibi, kwasawuli tuna malajitso ga Musa awu kwasawuli tunlongotswa na lusungu lwa Mulungu? Ndaya bee! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Mbe, sinambemutsele kuta hila fyo mungitawula kuva vapogotsi va munu na kumuhulikitsa, munkuva va munu uyo? Manyi muve wapogotsi va ndongwa ntsibi hawudugo mukufwa. Manyi mwitawule na kuva vatantsi va kumuhulikitsa Mulungu, mukuva vawuya halutalo hake. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Nayivaje hala katali henye mwavaga vapogotsi va ndongwa ntsibi, lechelelo alumbwaje Mulungu kwasawuli sambi mwanuche kwa numbula tsenyu tseka na kugahulikitsa madahitso go mudahitswe. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Homwavaga kugombolwa na kuvikwa kutali na ndongwa ntsibi mukavaje vapogotsi vakudita ndongwa tso angutsigana Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Ndontsile na henye kwa muhwano gwa mupogotsi ili mwelewe chila cho ntsinlonga. Hala katali mwafitawulaga filungo fyenyu kwa kudita ndongwa tsibi na ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi tsavaga tsolofu ndalahela, lechelelo sambi mun'ganika mufitawulaje filungo fyenyu siku tseka, muve vapogotsi va kudita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu. Muve vanu wo van'dita ndongwa tso an'gana Mulungu ili kulajila kuta henye wo vanu va Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Kwasawuli hala katali ho mwavaga muvapogotsi va ndongwa ntsibi, simwahotsaga kudita ndongwa tso aganaga Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Lelo mwapasile chichi kwa ndongwa tsila tso mungutsiwonela nyoni sambi? Kwasawuli wudugo wa ndongwa itso wukuvaletela chifo! <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Lechelelo sambi mwanga mulekitswe muhume mu wupogotsi na kuvikwa kutali na ndongwa ntsibi na sambi muveye vatantsi va Mulungu na muveye vanu vake na wudugo wake mukupata wumi wo wugaya wudugo. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Ihyo mutselaje kuta manyi mudite ndongwa ntsibi hawudugo mukufwa, lechelelo chifunje cha Mulungu wo wula wumi wo wugaya wudugo kukolela kwa Chilisito Yesu Mutwa vetu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa vanu wo vitweye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Nyee, vang'olotsangu, ntsin'tsela kuta ntsinlongana na vala wo vagatsele malajitso ga Musa. Mbe, simun'tsela kuta malajitso ga Musa gamutavalaga munu hala ho ang'acha mumi? <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Kota hila mudala yo atoliche si afuluche atoleche na mulume yunji manyi mulume vake ang'acha mumi, lechelelo manyi mulume afwe, mudala yula akuva adindulwe na gala malajitso ga noleka. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Ihyo mudala uyo manyi atoleche na mulume yunji, na kuno mulume vake ang'acha mumi, mudala uyo akuchemwa mwaafu. Lechelelo manyi mulume vake afwe, malajitso ga noleka gakuva gamulechye mudala uyo, nayo afuluche atoleche na mulume yunji na si akuchemwa mwaafu. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Hihyo na henye vang'olotsangu, muveye hulu kwa malajitso ga Musa hala wunu wenyu wa katali ho wafweye hamwe na Chilisito, kukolela muvili gwa Chilisito na muveye mali ya munu yunji yo atsilipulwe, ili tudite ndongwa nofu kwajili ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Kwasawuli hala hotwavaga tungikala kota vanu fyo vikalaga, malagitso ga Musa gatwambutsaga mbwiniwo tsa ndonwa tsibi tsatutifyaga mufilungo fyetu, na hetwe tweka tukakudujila muchifo. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Iho katali twavaga tuwopitwe na malajitso ga Musa lechelelo sambi tufweye hamwe na Chilisito, ihyo tudinduliwe kuhuma mu malagitso ga Musa. Lelo sinambe tumutumichile Mulungu kota katali kwa kufwata malajitso go gandikwe. Ila tungumutumichila Mulungu kwa kulongotswa na Muhe vake.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malajitso ga Musa na ndongwa ntsibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Tulonje chichi lelo, kuta malajitso ga Musa go ndongwa ntsibi? Ndaya bee! Lechelelo si ntsika kutsela kuta ndongwa ntsibi cho chinu chachi bila kugatsela malajitso ga Musa. Kwasawuli si ntsika kutsela kiwiniwa kuta kuli fibi manyi malajitso ga Musa gaka gave sigalontsile, “Walahogola kiwiniwa.” <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Lechelelo fyo ntsavaga kutsela ndongwa ntsibi, tsikavetsaje kulamusa chila ayina ya mbwiniwo ntsibi mugati mwangu. Kwasawuli manyi kuve kuduhu malajitso, ndongwa ntsibi tsinguva tsilihela ludali. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Luvala lutunga hontsavaga kutali na malajitso ga Musa ntsikalaga kota fyo ntsin'gana heni, lechelelo hogavaga kutsa malajitso, ndongwa ntsibi natso tsikalamukaje, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />na ngafwaje. Iho ngatselaje kuta lilajitso lyo lyaganaga kuleta wumi, likatsambutsaje nyingwe chifo. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Ihyo Ndongwa ntsibi tsikapataje nyafwasi ya kundeteletsa tsikatsambutsaje nyingwe chifo. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Wukweli kuta malajitso ga Musa gahumye kwa Mulungu, majitso igo galifinofu na kaha galihela wubi. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Mbe, lulongwa luno lunlajila kuta chila chinu chinofu chambutse nyigwe chifo? Ndaya bee! Ila ndongwa ntsibi ili tsiwoneche nachene kuta tso ndongwa ntsibi, tsatumye chila chinu chinofu kwambutsa nyigwe chifo. Ihyo ndongwa ntsibi, kukolela malajitso gala yinlajila nachene kuta ndongwa ntsibi tsiwoneche kuva ntsibi ndalahela.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wusumwano mugati mwa munu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Tun'tsela kuta malajitso ga Mulungu go apelitwe Musa galetitwe kwasawuli ya ndongwa tsa chi muhe, lechelelo heni ntsili munu yo ntsinlongotswa na muvili, kuno ntsili mu wupogotsi wa ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Heni sinambe ntsichelewe chila cho ntsinguchidita, kwasawuli chila cho ntsin'gana kudita, ntsinlemwa kudita, lechelelo chila chosinambe ntsichigane cho ntsinguchidita. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Lechelelo manyi ntsinguludita lula lulongwa lo sinambe ntsilugane, ntsingugadikitsa kuta malajitso kuta go manofu. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Ihyo lelo siyo heni yo ntsin'gana kudita ndongwa tso sinambe ntsitsigane, ila lula ludali lwa ndongwa ntsibi loluli mugati mwa heni. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Kwasawuli ntsin'tsela kuta mugati mwangu ntsilihela lulongwa lunofu lulove, kwakuva ntsin'gana kudita lulongwa lunofu, lechelelo ntsinlemwa kuludita. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Lula lulongwa lunofu lo ntsingulugana, sintsinguludita, ila lula lubi losinambe ntsilugane lo ntsinguludita. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Lelo manyi losinambe ntsilugane lo ntsinguludita, siyo heni yo ntsin'gana kuludita, ila tsila ndongwa ntsibi tsotsili mugati mwa heni. <verse eid="ROM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Ihyo ntseliwe chinu chino kuta ho ntsin'gana kudita lulongwa lunofu, ntsinkwegwa kuludita lula lubi lo sinambentsilugane. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Munumbula yangu ntsingugasangalila malajitso ga Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Lechelelo ntseliwe kuta kuna malajitso ganji go gankola katsi mu muvili gwangu, malajitso go gankuva tebe na malajitso na gala mahotso gangu manofu. Ihyo malajitso igo gan'dita ntsive mupogotsi va malajitso ga ndongwa ntsibi tsotsinkola katsi mu muvili gwangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Nyee, ntsinalyo ntsimuyenyu! Nani yo akung'ulusa na muvili guno go gun'sindika ku chifo? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Ntsingumulumba Mulungu kwa wukuluso wake kukolela kwa Yesu Chilisito Mutwa vetu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Ihyo duve, fyotsili heni kwa nyala tsangu ntsingugafwata malajitso ga Mulungu, ila kwa muvili gwangu ntsinkwegwa kudita ndongwa ntsibi.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Wumi mugati mwa Muhe va Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Lelo kuduhu kuhigwa chifo kwa vanu vala wo vamutumbye Chilisto Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Kwasawuli seliya ya Muhe va Mulungu yo yingutupela wumi kwa kihantsa na Chilisito Yesu, tsing'ulwise na seliya ya ndongwa ntsibi na chifo. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Mulungu aludisile lulogwa lula lo lwasumikaga kukoleka kwa malajitso ga Musa kwasawuli ya wutenyanjifu wa wunu wetu. Ihyo Mulungu amutumile Mwanage munya muvili kota hetwe fyotuli ili atsisume ndongwa ntsibi, na kwa muvili ugo akatsanangaje itso ndongwa ntsibi, <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Mulungu adisile ihyo ili tudite ndongwa tsila tsotsilajitswe na malajitso ga Musa, ili hetwe wosinambe twikale kwa kutsifwata mbwiniwo tsa muvili, tulongotswe na Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Kwakuva vanu vala wo vangikala kwa kufwata mbwiniwo tsa muvili vahotsaga ndongwa tsa muvili, ila vala wo vanlongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu vahotsaga ndongwa tso an'gana Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Kwakuva mahotso goganlongotswa na muvili galetaga chifo ng'ani, lechelelo mahotso goganlongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu galetaga wumi wa siku tseka na wusichimafu. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Siku tseka mahotso ga munu gatelanaga na Mulungu, kwasawuli munu yo anlongotswa na muvili si ahulikitsaga malajitso ga Mulungu, na kaha si akuvetsa kugahulikitsa. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Vanu wo vangikala kwa kulongotswa na mbwiniwo tsa muvili sivafuluche vadite kota fyo an'gana Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Lechelelo manyi Muhe va Mulungu ave mugati mwenyu henye nambe munlongotswa na muvili, ila mukuva munlongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu. Ihyo munu yoyuve manyi ave alihela Muhe va Chilisito, uyo siyo munu va Chilisito. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Manyi Chilisito ave ali mugati mwenyu, mivili jenyu jikuva kota jifweye kwa ndongwa ntsibi, ila numbula tsenyu tsinkuva na wumi kwasawuli tsin'dita kota hila fyoan'gana Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Lechelelo manyi Muhe va Mulungu yo amutsilipwe Yesu angikala mugati mwenyu, akujidita mivili jenyu jo jinya hali ya kufwa jive myumi, akudita ihyo kwa kukolela kwa Muhe vake yo angikala mugati mwenyu.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Ihyo lelo vang'olotsangu tutselaje kuta tun'dayilwa lulongwa, situn'ganika kikala kwa kulongotswa mbwiniwo tsa muvili. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Kwasawuli manyi mwikale kwa kufwata ndongwa tsa muvili, mukuva mun'gana kufwa. Lechelelo manyi mukopole ng'olwa tsa mivili kwa Muhe va Mulungu, mukikala. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Ihyo vanu vala wo vanlongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu, iwo wo vana va Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Kwakuva simwanuchilye Muhe va wupogotsi yo anguvaletela muhwehwe, ila mwanuchilye Muhe va kuvadita muve vana va Mulungu na kwa yuyo Muhe hetwe tungumuchema Mulungu, “Haba,” chinya kulonga, “Dada.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aba lihumile mu likabila lya Chiyalamu chinya kutijila Dada, vatumilaga vana kuvachema valeli vawo </char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Muhe va Mulungu mwene alongaga mu numbula tsetu, kuta kweli hetwe tuli vana va Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Duve lelo, manyi tuli vana va Mulungu, tukwanuchila fifunje fyo alontsile Mulungu kuta akuvapela vanu vake, kaha tukupata fifunje ifyo hamwe na Chilisito. Eena, manyi twihantse na mwene mu ng'odeko tsake, kaha tukuva hamwe nayo mu wumelemo wake.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wuvina wo wunkutsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Ng'odeko tsa luvala luno lwa sambi ntsingutsiwona kota si chinu ndaya, manyi nywanitse na wuvina wula wa Mulungu wo akutupela uko kulutalo. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Kwakuva fiwumbe fyeka fin'tsinda kwa hamu ngomi, hala Mulungu ho akugubula kuva vanage wo vanani. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Ihyo finu fyeka fyavisilwe mu wutenyanjifu, siyo kwa kugana fyene, ila kwasawuli yake mwene Mulungu. Nambe ihyo kung'acha kuna lihuvi. <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Nafyo fiwumbe fyene nafyo fikukuluswa mu wupogotsi na wutenyanjifu, hala hofikwinjila mu wuvina wa vana va Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Tun'tsela kuta fiwumbe fyeka fintamika hohamwe, nafyo fina wusungu wukomi kota wula wa mudala kulela mwana. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Kaha siyo fiwumbe ifyo ng'ani, lechelelo na hetwe yo tuna Muhe va Mulungu yo chifunje chilongola cha Mulungu, kaha na hetwe tung'ung'uta mu numbula tsetu kwa kuntsinda kuditwa kuva vana Mulungu na mivili jetu jigombolwe. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Kwasawuli kwa lihuvilo ilyo hetwe twakuluswe, lechelelo lihuvilo likuva na katsi yachi manyi tunguchiwona chila cho tuchihuvilije. Mbe, munu vachi yo atsindilaga chinu cho mwanga achiwene? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Lechelelo manyi tunguchihuvila chinu cho tulihela, ihyo tuchitsindaga kwa kikangatsa.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Hetwe tulivatenyanjifu, ila Muhe va Mulungu atutangaga, kwasawuli tulemwaga kusuka hila fyo yin'ganika, lechelelo Muhe mwene atusuchilaga kwa Mulungu kwa kuguta ko sikufuluche kulonjeche. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Mwene Mulungu yo alolaga mbaka mugati mu numbula tsa vanu na an'tsela chila cho anhotsa Muhe, kwasawuli uyo Muhe va Mulungu avasuchilaga vanu kota fyo an'gana Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Hetwe tun'tsela kuta mu ndongwa tseka Mulungu akolaga katsi hamwe na vala veka wo vangumugana na avapelaga ndongwa nofu, wo vala wo vachemilwe kota hila fyo an'gana mwene. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Vanu vala wo avahagwe luhuma katali, wo avabagwe ili vihwane na Mwanage, ili uyo Mwanage ave mulelwa mulongola hagati ha vang'olotse wolofu. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Nawo vala yo alongwe kuvahagula luhuma katali, iwo wo akavachemaje, nawo wo avachemile, wo iwo wo avadisile vave vawuya, na vala wo avadisile vave vawuya, wo iwo akavavikaje mu wumelemo wake.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wugano wa Mulungu kukolela kwa Chilisito Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Lelo tulonje chichi kwa ndongwa itso? Manyi Mulungu ave lubali lwetu, nani yo afuluche asumane na hetwe? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Mulungu alesile kumutanila Mwana vake va wiyeka, ila amutawe kwasawuli yetu hetwe tweka. Manyi adisile ihyo akulemwa kutupela chinu chinji chochive cho tun'gana? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Nani yo akuvalonjeletsa vahagulwa va Mulungu? Kwasawuli Mulungu mwene mwanga avadichye vave vanu vake. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Lelo nani yo afuluche avahije kuta mukosise? Kwasawuli Chilisito Yesu yo afweye, kulutila ifyo fyeka akatsilipukaje, ichite lubali lwa wutavala wsa Mulungu. Nayo yo angutusuchila hetwe. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Nani yo afuluche kutulekanitsa na wugano wa Chilisito? Mbe, ntsala awu ng'odeko awu wusawufu, awu ng'oko awu chifo, awu wugayu? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Kota fyo yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">“Kwasawuli ya heve tumfwimwa hamunyi na hachilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">tunkuva kota ng'olo tsa kusintswa.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Lechelelo kwa ndongwa itso tseka hetwe tuli vasumi nachene, kwasawuli tuntangwa na Chilisito yo atuganile <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Kwasawuli mwanga ntseliwe nachene kuta, kuduhuli chinu cho chive cho chifuluche chitubagule na wugano wa Mulungu, siyo chifo awu wumi, vave vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu awu vanya mamulaka, awu fyo finhumila sambi awu fyo fikuhumila hambele awu vanya wuvetso, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />awu inyi ya kilanga awu inyi ya hasi ndalahela. Kuduhuli chinu chochive cho chifuluche chitulekanitse na wugano wa Mulungu wowuli kwa Chilisito Yesu Mutwa vetu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu na vanu vake Vaisilaheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Ntsinlonga wukweli ng'ani kwakuva ntsili mugati mwa Chilisito, nayo Muhe va Mulungu yo an'ndongotsa mu numbula yangu an'ndajila kuta sintsinlonga wudesi, <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />ntsin'gana kulonga kuta ntsina ng'ung'uto ngomi mu numbula yangu na wusungu ndalahela. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Yika kuva chiba heni ng'otolwe na mbikwe kutali na Chilisito, kwasawuli ya vang'olotsangu Vayawudi wo vanu va inyi yangu, <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />iwo wo Vaisilaheli, wo avahagwe vave vanage. Mulungu akavahantsaje mu wuvina wake na kuvika nawo gala malagano, akavapelaje malajitso gake, litumbilo lya wukweli na kuvatumbitsa cho alontsile. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Iwo Vaisilaheli tso ntsukulu tsa vakuku vetu, nayo Chilisito kwa wunu wake ahumye mu lukolo lwawo. Mulungu yo antavala finu fyeka atsumitswe siku tseka bila wudugo. Eena!<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Sintsinlonga kuta chila cho avatumbitse Mulungu chananjiche, kwasawuli siyo Vaisilaheli veka wo vahagulwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Siyo lulelo lweka lwa Ibulahimu kuta wo vana vake nachene, ila kota fyo galajilaga mandiko ga Mulungu, “Lulelo lwake lukuhumila kwa Isaka.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Tufuluche tulonje kuta, siyo vana veka wo valeliche kota vanu vanji fyo valelekaga kuta wo vana va Mulungu, ila vala wo valeliche kota fyo alontsile Mulungu iwo wo vakuvalilwa kuta vana va Ibulahimu. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Kwasawuli chila cho avatumbitse Mulungu cho ichino, “Nguwuya kaha kwa luvala kota luno kumwaka, nayo Sala akulela mwana mukwamitsi.”<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Kaha si ihyo ng'ani, ila Lebeka nayo apasile wubofu wa vana vanya mbili kwa Isaka mulume vake, yo dada vetu. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Lechelelo ili Mulungu awoneche kuta yo munya wuvetso wa kuhagula, nambe vala vana hovavaga vang'ali kuleleka na vang'acha kwantsa kudita lulongwa loluve lunofu au lubi, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Lebeka yuvawo akalonjelwaje na Mulungu, “Mwana mulongola kuleleka akuva mupogotsi va mwana yula yo akuleleka mumbele.” Ihyo wuhagutsi wa Mulungu wusilaga kota fyo an'gana mwene, na siyo kwa kulava ng'olwa tsa munu. <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Kota fyo yandikwe mu mandiko ga Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:13">“Ntsimuganile Yakobo, lechelelo Esawu ntsimuvipye.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Lelo tulonje chichi? Kuta mbe, Mulungu alihela wuwuya? Ndaya! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Kwakuva avaga amulonje Musa, “Ngumuwonela lusungu munu yoyuve yo ngugana ngumuwonela lusungu, na kaha ngumuhulumila munu yoyuve yo ngugana kumuhulumila.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Hoihyo ndongwa tseka tsihuvilaga lusungu lwa Mulungu na siyo kota hila fyo an'gana munu. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Ihyo Mandiko ga Mulungu ganlonga ndongwa tsa Fwalawo kuta, “Ntsakuvisile uve muntsajila, ili kukolela kwa heve ndajile wuvetso wangu na litawa lyangu livikulwe ku inyi tseka.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Ino lelo yitselanikaje kuta Mulungu amuhulumilaga munu yoyuve yo akugana kumuhulumila, na manyi agane kumudita munu ave na numbula ng'angafu akumudita ave na numbula ng'angafu.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbipo ya Mulungu na lusungu lwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Duve ufuluche umbutse heni kuta, “Manyi ndongwa tsili ihyo, mbona Mulungu angutukalalila kuta tunkosela? Nani yo afuluche asumwane na chila cho an'gana mwene?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Lechelelo bee munu, heve uli nani yo ufuluche ulongane na Mulungu? Mbe, chiya chifuluche chimulonjele muwufi kuta, “Kwasawuli yachi umbufile hino?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Mbe, muwufi si afuluche ave na wuvetso wa kuwumba chiya chimwe chive cha kuhesimilwa na chinji chive sicha kuhesimilwa, kuhuma mu liwulungwa limwe?<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Hihyo fyoluli kwa Mulungu, aganaga kulajila mbipo yake na wuvetso wake. Duve Mulungu atsindilaga kwa wukangatso wukomi ndalahela na kuvafumilila vala wo vaganikaga kupata mbipo yake, wo vawo wo vaganikaga vakopolwe. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Kaha Mulungu aganaga awulajile wukomi wa wuvina wake kwa vanu wo avawonelye lusungu ili vanuchile fifunje fyake, vala wo avadisile vapate wuvina uwo. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Ihyo hetwe wo vala wo atuchemile, si kuhuma kwa Vayawudi ng'ani, ila na kuhuma kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Kota hila fyo alontsile mu chitabu cha Hoseya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">“Nguvachema, Vanu vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">vala wosi vavaga vanu vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">kaha ngumuchema, Mwendi vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">mwene yosi avaga mwendi vangu,<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Kaha yikuva hono hala hovalontsilwe kuta, henye si muli vanu vangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">Ihyo vakuchemwa, Vana va Mulungu yo mumi.”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Nayo Isaya muloli va Mulungu akavalonjelaje fikami vanu Vaisilaheli, “Nayivaje Vaisilaheli wolofu kota luhanga lwa mubahali, wo vakukuluswa vakuva vanu vadodo hela, <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />kwasawuli Mutwa siakuhava kuvahiga vanu va inyi tseka.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Kaha kota Isaya fyo alongwe kulonga, “Manyi Mutwa Mulungu munya wuvetso weka akaave si atulechelye lulelo vana vatunga Vaisilaheli, tukakuva kota muji gwa Sodoma na tuka kuhwanitswa na muji gwa Gomola.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaisilaheli valema kitumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Lelo tulonje chinu chachi? Kuta vanu wosi Vayawudi wosi vakasasile vadichilwe na Mulungu, iwo wo Mulungu avagavye vapate kudichilwa kwa kumutumba, <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />ila vanu Vaisilaheli kwa kufwata malajitso ga Musa ga kuvadita vadichilwe na Mulungu, vakalemwaje kudichilwa kwa malajitso igo. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Kwasawuli yachi? Vakalemile kitumba, lechelelo vakafwataje ng'olwa tsawo. Vakikuvalaje mu liganga likomi lya kukuvatsa. <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Kota fyo yandikwe mu Mandiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">“Lave! Ntsin'vika ku muji gwa Sayuni liganga lya kikuvala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">na litalawe litelefu lya kugwisa, lechelelo kwa yula yo akumutumba Mulungu si akuhonjelwa nyoni nachene.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Vang'olotsangu, chila cho ntsin'gana ndalahela mu numbula yangu na suka yangu kwa Mulungu siku tseka, vang'olotsangu Vaisilaheli vakuluswe. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Ntsinguvalonjela kuta, vanu iwo vangikangatsa ndalahela kumusaka Mulungu, lechelelo kumusaka kwawo van'dita bila ntselo tsa kweli. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Ihyo sivatselaga hila Mulungu fyo avaditaga vanu ili vidichilwe na mwene, nawo vakajelaje kwantsisa ng'asi yawo vene, na ihyo vayilemile ng'asi iyo ya Mulungu ya kuvadita ili vidichilwe na mwene. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Chilisito ho avaga kutsa, malajitso ga Musa gakavaje siyo gakihuvila hala munu hoan'gana kidichilwa na Mulungu, ila vanu vidichilwe na Mulungu kwa kumutumba Chilisito.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wukuluso wuli kwasawuli ya vanu veka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Musa andiche hino kwa ndongwa tsa wuwuya wo afuluche awupate munu kwa kugafwata malajitso, “Munu yoyuve yo angikala na kugahulikitsa malajitso, munu uyo an'ganika ikale kwa kugafwata malajitso igo.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Lechelelo yandikwe hino, hila munu fyo afuluche idichilwe na Mulungu kwa kitumba, “Walahogola ulonje mu numbula yako kuta, Nani yo akukwina kubita kilanga kwa Mulungu? Kwa kulonga ihyo unkuva ungumwisa hanyi Chilisito.” <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Awu uleche kulonga kuta, “Munu vachi yo afuluche kubita kwa vanu wo vafweye? Kwa kulonga ihyo unkuva ungumuleta Chilisito kuhuma ku inyi ya vanu wo vafweye.” <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Lechelelo mandiko ganlonga ndawuli? “Wujumbe wa Mulungu wuli habehi na heve, wuli mu mulomo gwako na mu numbula yako.” Uwo wo wujumbe wa ndongwa tsa litumbilo tso tungutsivikula. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Ihyo manyi umudichile Chilisito kwa kulonga kwa mulomo gwako lwa kuta mwene yo Mutwa, na kitumbila mu numbula yako lwa kuta Mulungu amutsilipwe, ukukuluswa. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Kwakuva munu manyi atumbe kwa numbula yake akidichilwa na Mulungu, na manyi ihale kwa mulomo gwake akupata wukuluso. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Kota mandiko ga Mulungu fyo ganlonga, “Chila munu yo angumutumba siafuluche ahonje nyoni.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Kuduhu wubagulo kwa Muyawudi awu munu yosi Muyawudi, mwene yula yo Mutwa va veka, munya wugano ndalahela kwa vala veka wo vangumusuka. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Mandiko ga Mulungu ganlonga, “Chila munu yo akumuchema Mutwa kwa kugana kutangwa, uyo akukuluswa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Mbe, vafuluche vamusuche ndawuli mwene yosinambe vamutumbe? Kaha vakumutumba chinyandawuli mwene yosi vamuhuliche ndongwa tsake? Kaha vakumuhulika chinyandawuli bila munu kuvavikulila ndongwa tsake? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Kaha vakuvikula ndawuli manyi sivasindikwe? Kota fyo yandikwe, “Vanofu kota chichi vanu vala wo vanvikula Ndongwa Nofu!” <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Lechelelo siyo vanu veka wo vanuche tsila Ndongwa Nofu. Nambe Isaya muloli va Mulungu alontsile, “Mutwa, nani yo atsitumbye ndongwa tsila tso tutumilwe?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Duve, litumbilo litsaga kwa kuhulika wujumbe, na wujumbe wuhumaga mu Ndongwa Nofu tsa Chilisito.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Leche ntsivaputse, mbe vene sivakahuliche wujumbe uwo? Nachene! Vahuliche, kota mandiko ga Mulungu fyo ganlonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">“Vanu vavikwe wujumbe wa Mulungu chila hono, na vanu vahuliche wujumbe wa Mulungu mbaka ku wudugo wa inyi.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Kaha mbwile kuvaputsa, mbe, Vasilaheli sivakatselye? Musa mwene alongwe kulonga kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">“Nguvadita muvawonele wifu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">vanu wosi vanu va inyi yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">Nguvadita muvawonele lilakali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">vanu va inyi ya vanu vapuva.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Hambele kaha Isaya alontsile bila muloto goguve kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">“Ngawonekaje kwa vanu wosi vasakaga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">ngilajilaje kwa vanu vala wo sinambe vawutsanitse ndongwa tsangu.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Lechelelo kwa vanu Vaisilaheli Isaya anlonga, “Kwa luvala lweka ntsavagongoletsaga vanu vangu kwa kuvachema ili vamituchile heni, lechelelo vene valemile kunyulikitsa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Lusungu lwa Mulungu kwa Vaisilaheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Lelo ntsimputsa mbe, Mulungu avakanile vanu vake? Ndaya! Heni mwene ntsi Muisilaheli va lulelo lwa Ibulahimu, ntsili munu va likabila lya Benjamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Mulungu siavalemile vanu vake yo avatselite luhuma hamutalo. Mbe, sinambe mugasele Mandiko go ganlonga kwa ndongwa tsa Eliya hila fyo amukalalye Mulungu kwasawuli ya vana va Isilaheli? <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />Eliya alontsile kuta, “Mutwa, vavakopwe valoli vako na kuhabomola hono hako ha kutawulila nambiko, sije ntsiliyeka hela nawo van'gana kung'opola.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Mbe, Mulungu amupitwe chinyandawuli? Amulonje, “Ntsisigatsilye vanu vangu elufu saba yo sinambe valifugamile lilungu Baali.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Duve, nambe sambi yili hihyo, kuna vanu vatunga wo vasije wo avahagwe Mulungu kwa wuwuya wake. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Mulungu avahagulwe kwa wuwuya wake, siyo kwasawuli ya ndongwa tsawo tso van'dita. Manyi yika yive kwasawuli ya ndongwa tsawo tso van'dita, wuwuya siwukakuva wuwuya ndaya!<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Ino lelo tulonje chinu chachi, vanu Vaisilaheli <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vaisilaheli kaha vachemwaga Vayawudi</char></note>sivachipasile chila chinu cho vavaga vanguchisaka? Vahagulwa veka vapasile, ila vanu vanji wo vasije numbula tsawo tsadisilwe kuva ng'angafu. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Kota hila fyo yandikwe, “Mulungu avadisile vave kota vanu yo vavasise na mbaka munyi guno vaveye kota vanu wo vavasise na kuhulika kwa mapulichililo gawo.”<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Nayo Dawudi anlonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">“Mawungo gawo ga kulya gavaje mitego ja kuvagwilisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">ili vagwe na kutowa.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Miho gawo gavaje na jitsa ili galeche kulava,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">na migongo jawo jibibindale kwa ng'odeko siku tseka.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Ihyo ntsimputsa kaha, mbe, Vaisilaheli vikuve na kugwa sivakuvetsa kwinuka kanji? Ndaya! Lechelelo kwasawuli ya kukosela kwawo, wukuluso wufisile na kwa vanu wosi Vaisilaheli ili kuvadita Vaisilaheli vavawonele wifu. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Kukosela kwawo Vayawudi kuvadisile vanu wosi Vayawudi vave na wusangalo na Mulungu, na kuyaga kwawo kwa chi muhe kudisile Mulungu ave na wusangalo na vanu wosi Vayawudi. Lelo munhotsa ndawuli, Vayawudi wolofu ho vakuva vamupituchilye Mulungu na kudita kota fyo an'gana mwene. Mbe, sinambemuhotse kuta Mulungu akulutila kuva na wusangalo na vanu wosi Vayawudi?<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukuluswa kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Lelo ntsinloga na henye vanu wosi Vayawudi. Kwa hila fyo ntsili mutumi va vanu wosi Vayawudi, ntsinguyitsumila katsi yangu ya wuvikutsi, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />ili ntsivadite vanu va inyi yangu vawone wifu, na ihyo ntsivadite vanu vatunga vakuluswe. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Manyi kukanwa kwawo kudisile vanu va inyi tseka vapataniswe na Mulungu. Mbe, yikuva ndawuli hala hovakuva vidichilwe na Mulungu? Vanu wo vafweye vakutsilipuka!<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Manyi chipande chilongola cha mukate chitawulwe kwa Mulungu mukate gweka gukuva gwa Mulungu. Manyi ndela tsa mubichi tsive tsitawulwe kwa Mulungu, na mitambi najo jikuva jitawulwe kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Eee, mitambi jinji ja mibichi ja mitsayituni mu chinyungu jatemilwe, na litambi linji lya litsayituni lya mwijejele livisilwe hono hawo. Henye vanu wosi Vayawudi wo litambi lya mutsayituni lya mwijejele, wo sambi mwihantsitse mu wumi wa mutsayituni gwa muchinyungu. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Ihyo lelo, mulekaje kuvabedala vanu vala wo vatemilwe kota mitambi. Lelo mungidutsila chinu chachi? Nambe kuve na lulongwa lwa kidutsila, mwiwukaje kuta siyo henye yo mungutsitanga ndela tsa mubichi, ila ndela tso tsinguvatanga henye.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Lechelelo mufuluche mulonje, “Mitambi jila jatemilwe ili hetwe tuvikwe mu libichi ilyo.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Eee, mitambi jila jatemilwe kwasawuli ya kuleka kitumba kwawo, lechelelo heve wimile kwasawuli ya kitumba kwako. Lelo ulekaje kidutsa, ila un'ganika wime kwa kiyangalila. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Manyi Mulungu si avawonye lusungu Vayawudi wo mitambi jakuhuma katali. Mbe, afuluche avaleche henye? <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Lave lelo! Hila Mulungu fyo muwuya na mukali. Mwene avaga mukali kwa vanu vala wo van'dita tebe na mwene, nayo kaha avaga muwuya kwa heve yo unkwendelela kudita kota fyo an'gana, na manyi uve tebe nayo ukutsogolwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Manyi Vayawudi nawo valeche kuva tebe na Mulungu, mwene akuvavika kaha hala hovavaga. Kwasawuli Mulungu anawo wuvetso wa kuvavika kaha hala hovavaga. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Henye vanu wosi Vayawudi munakota litambi lya mutseyituni lya mwijejele, ila muhetsitswe uko na kuvikwa hono iho luhuma katali siyo henyu. Lechelelo Vayawudi luhuma katali vene vanakota mutseyituni gwa mu chinyungu, kwa vene kuna wupefu wa kupilulwa kaha mu mubichi go gwawo.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaisilaheli veka vakukuluswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Vang'olotsangu ntsin'gana muwutsele wukweli wo wufihime, ili muleche kidutsa kuta muna nyala ntsongofu. Chidada cha Vayawudi chavaga cha luvala ludodo hela, mbaka hala vanu vanji wosi Vayawudi ho vakuva vamutumbye Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Ihyo Vaisilaheli vakukuluswa kota fyo yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">“Mukulusi akutsa kuhuma ku muji gwa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">akuvahetsela valelwa va Yakobo ndongwa tsawo ntsibi.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Ili lyo lilagano lyangu lyo ngulagana nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">hala honguvahetsela ndongwa tsawo ntsibi.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Sambi Vayawudi valemile Ndongwa Nofu, kwa kudita ihyo vaveye vatelani va Mulungu kwafwayida ya henye wosi mu Vayawudi. Ihyo mutselaje kuta vang'acha vahagulwa va Mulungu na wo van'ganwa kwasawuli ya lilagano lyo avaga avisile Mulungu na vakuku vawo. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Mulungu si agalulaga mahotso gake kwa vanu vala wo avahagwe na kuvapela fifunje. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Kota hila hala katali henye vanu wosi Vayawudi fyo mwavaga vatelani va Mulungu, lechelelo sambi mupasile lusungu lwa Mulungu kwasawuli Vayawudi vateline na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Hohihyo kwasawuli ya lusungu lo mwapasile henye, Vayawudi vantelana na Mulungu ili na vene vanuchile sambi lusungu lwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Vanu veka vakosise kwa kuleka kumuhulichitsa Mulungu, ili mwene alajile lusungu lwake kwa veka.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu atsumitswe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Eee, Mulungu anafyo finu fyolofu finofu ndalahela! Ntselo tsake hamwe na nyala tsake tsilihela wudugo. Kaha kuduhuli munu yo afuluche kuwuhadisa wulamulo wake na ng'asi tsake sinambe tsitselaniche. <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Kota Mandiko fyo ganlonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">“Mbe, nani yo an'tsela mahontso ga Mutwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">Awu nani yo afuluche amulonjele Mulungu cha kulamula?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Mbe, nani yo alongwe kumupela Mulungu chinu chochive,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:35">ili ahombwe?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Kwasawuli finu fyeka finhuma kwa mwene na hofili kwasawuli ya wuvetso wake na hofili kwasawuli yake. Wuvina wuvaje kwake mwene siku tseka tsotsigaya wudugo! Eena.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Kitawula kwasawuli ya kumutumichila Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Ihyo lelo vang'olotsangu kwakuva Mulungu yo munya lusungu lukomi, ntsinguvagongola kuta mwitawule henye vene kwa Mulungu kota nambiko na yoyingumugan'ya Mulungu, lechelelo muvaje wumi, ihyo fyo mun'ganika kudita kwa kumufugamila Mulungu kwa wukweli. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Mulekaje kuhotsa kota tso van'dita vanu va mu inyi fyo vanhotsa, ila Mulungu avabadilaje henye kwa kuditwa wupya mahotso genyu. Ihyo ho mukuvetsa kutsela nachene chila cho an'gana Mulungu, mukutsitsela ndongwa nofu tso tsingumugan'ya na tsa wukwitso kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Kwa lusungu lo masile kuhuma kwa Mulungu ntsinguvalonjela nyeka kuta, chila munu alekaje kuhotsa kuta ali chinu kulutila muyage, lechelelo mwipimaje muvene kwa litumbilo lyo avapelye Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Kota hila muvili gumwe fyo guna filungo fyolofu, na chila chilungo chiditaga katsi yake. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Hohihyo na hetwe kota fyo tuwolofu, ila tuli muvili gumwe kwa kula kihantsa na Chilisito, lechelelo chila munu ali chilungo kwa muyage. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Chila munu anacho chifunje cho apelitwe kwa lusungu lwa Mulungu. Ihyo lelo yo apelitwe chifunje cha wuloli wa Mulungu alongaje wuloli kota litumbilo lyake fyolili. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Munu munya kuvetsa kukola katsi ya Mulungu akolaje katsi iyo, na yo apelitwe katsi ya kudahitsa adahitsaje, <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />munu yo apelitwe katsi ya kuvahongetsa vanu avahongetsaje, yo apelitwe katsi ya kuvatanga vanu vanya wugayu avatangaje kwa wuwuya, na munu yo apelitwe katsi ya kwimilila imililaje bila kuleka, nayo munya kudita ndongwa tsa lusungu aditaje hihyo kwa wusangalo.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Kigana kwenyu kulekaje kuva kwa kideteletsa, mutsivipilaje ndongwa ntsibi na kutsidita ndongwa nofu. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Mwiganaje henye kwa henye, kwa hesima chila munu ahotsaje kwajili ya muyage na kumuwona kuta nayo munu. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Mulekaje kudita katsi ya Mulungu kwa wudejefu, ila muyikolaje kwa wukangatso na kwa numbula tsenyu tseka kwa kumutumichila Mutwa. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Lihuvilo lyenyu livaditaje musangalale, na homukuva mu ng'odeko mumutsindilaje na kuno mungumusuka Mulungu siku tseka. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Muvatangaje vanya litumbilo vayenyu mu wugayu wawo, muvalibulitsaje vajentsi kwa kusangalala.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Muvasuchilaje wuwuya vanu veka wo vanguvakoda henye, Eee! Muvasuchilaje wuwuya, mulekaje kuvakotola. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Muhechelelaje hamwe na vala wo vanhechelela, na kaha muvembaje na vala wo vamvemba. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Mwikalaje kwa wusichimafu henye kwa henye. Mulekaje kidutsa kuta muntsela chila chinu, ila muvaje hamwe nawo vanu wovam'bedalwa. Mulekaje kiwona kuta henye ng'ani wo muna nyala ndalahela.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Mulekaje kumupilulila munu yoyuve wubi kwa wubi. Mwikangatsaje kudita ndongwa tsila tso vanu vangutsitsela kuta nofu. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Muditaje chila chomukuvetsa ili mwikale kwa wusichimafu na vanu veka. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Nye vayangu, mulekaje kuvapilulila vanu wubi, lechelelo mumulechele Mulungu lulongwa ulo, mu Mandiko ga Mulungu ganlonga, Mutwa anlonga, “Kupilula wubi yo katsi ya heni, heni ngupilula.” <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Kulutila ihyo mandiko ganlonga, “Manyi mutelani vako ana ntsala, umupele chilyo, manyi ana ng'alu, umupele malenga ang'we. Kwa kudita ihyo ukumudita awone nyoni ndalahela.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Wubi wulekaje kukusuma, ila uwusumaje wubi kwa kudita wuwuya.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Kuvahulikitsa filongotsi va inyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Chila munu an'ganika avahulikitse filongotsi va Silikali, kwasawuli filongotsi veka vahumaga kwa Mulungu, nawo filongotsi vavisilwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Ihyo munu yo ankuva tebe na filongotsi va Silikali ankuva tebe na lilajitso lya Mulungu, nawo wo van'dita ihyo vakuhigwa. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Filongotsi sivavaditaga vanu vawuya vawone muloto, ila vavaditaga vanu vabi vawone muloto. Mbe, un'gana uleche kuwogopa vanya mamulaka? Ihyo un'ganika uditaje finofu, nawo vakukutsumila. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Kwakuva filongotsi iwo wo vatantsi va Mulungu wo van'kola katsi kwa fwayida yako. Lechelelo manyi udite fibi un'ganika uwogope, kwasawuli vafuluche vakupele atsabu. Vene wo vatantsi va Mulungu, vavisilwe ili kuvatova vala wo van'dita fibi. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Ihyo yin'ganika uvahulikitse filongotsi va Silikali, siyo kwasawuli ya muloto gwa kutowa na Mulungu, ila kwasawuli un'tsela kuta ulo lo lulongwa lo un'ganika kuludita.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Kwasawuli yiyo henye munhomba kodi, kwakuva filongotsi iwo vangumutumichila Mulungu kwa katsi iyo, hala ho van'dita kota hila fyo yin'ganika kudita. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Muvapelaje chila munu chila cho an'ganika kupelwa, munu mudaya kodi mumuhombaje kodi, munu va kudaya wusulu mumuhombaje wusulu, yo an'ganika kuhesimilwa, mumuhesimilaje.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvagana vanyalukolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Mulekaje kuva na lulongwa lubi na munu yoyuve, ila mun'ganika kwigana. Kwasawuli munu yo angumugana muyage akuva akwitsitse malajitso ga Mulungu go amupelye Musa. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Malajitso igo iga, “Walahogola kudita waafu, walahogola kukopola, walahogola kuhitsa, na kaha walahogola kiwiniwa chinu cha munu yunji.” Malajitso gano na gala geka gali mulilajitso ili limwe. “Umuganaje muyago kota fyo ungigana heve mwene.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Munu yo angumugana muyage siafuluche amuditile fibi. Duve wugano wo wukwitso wa malajitso ga Musa.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Kulutila fyeka, henye mun'tsela kuta tuli luvala lwachi! Uluno lo luvala lwa kulamuka mu tulo, kwasawuli wukuluso wetu wuli habehi ndalahela kulutila hala ho twantsaga kutumbila. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Chilo chilutye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Chilo mana yache, luvala lwa kudita ndongwa ntsibi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Hamunyi mana yache, luvala lwa kudita ndongwa nofu</char></note>, kuli habehi na kwela. Ihyo tuvikaje kutali ndongwa tseka tsa jitsa na tufwale fifwimilo fya ku mwangatsa. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Tun'ganika kikala kwa hesima kota hila vanu fyo vaganikaga kikala luvala lwa hamunyi, siyo kwa wuhatufu na wugatsi, na siyo kwa mbwiniwo tsa luswa na waafu, siyo kwa wupungani na wifu. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Lechelelo muhotsaje na kudita kota Mutwa venyu Yesu Chilisito, mulekaje kutsidichila mbwiniwo tsa mivili jenyu.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Mulekaje kihiga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Mumulibulitsaje munu munya litumbilo lidodo, mulekaje kumubedala mahotso gake. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Vanu si vihwanaga kitumba, munu yumwe litumbilo lyake sinambe limulemetse kulya chila chinu, lechelelo hoyoli munu yunji ana litumbilo lidodo yo alyaga mboga tsa mahamba ng'ani. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Yula yo ankulya chila chinu alekaje kumubedala yula yo sinambe alye chila chinu. Nayo yo ankulya mboga tsa mahamba ng'ani alekaje kumuhiga yula yo ankulya chila chinu, kwasawuli Mulungu amudiche. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Heve uli nani mbaka umuhije mutantsi va munu yunji? Kwasawuli muvina vake ng'ani yo an'tsela kwima awu kugwa kwake. Nayo akwima kwa wukangatso kwasawuli Mutwa vake anvetsa kumwimya.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Munu yumwe anhotsa kuta siku nunga yo ngomi kulutila siku tsinji, na yunji an'wona kuta siku tseka tsili sava hela. Ihyo lelo chila munu a'ganika kutsela nachene chila cho anguchifwata mu mahotso gake. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Munu yula yo anguyiwona siku yimwe kuva yo ngomi kwa Mulungu kulutila siku yinji, uyo aditaga ihyo kwasawuli ya kumutsumitsa Mutwa. Nayo yo ankulya filyo fyeka an'dita ihyo kwasawuli ya kumutsumitsa Mutwa, kwakuva angumulumba Mulungu. Kaha nayo yo anlema kulya filyo fitunga, aditaga ihyo kwa kumutsumitsa Mutwa, kwakuva nayo angumulumba Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Kwakuva kuduhuli nambe munu yoyuve yo ali hagati hetu yo angikala kwasawuli yake mwene, na kaha kuduhuli munu yoyuve yo ankufwa kwasawuli yake mwene. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Manyi tung'acha tungikala, tungikala kwajili ya Mutwa, na kaha manyi tukufwa tunkufwa kwajili ya Mutwa. Hoihyo duve, manyi tungikala awu manyi tufwe, tungikala kwajili ya kumugan'ya Mutwa, kwasawuli hetwe tuli vanu vake. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Chilisito akafweye na hambele akatsilipukaje ili ave Mutwa va veka, wo vafweye na wumi. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Lelo kwasawuli ya chichi heve ungumuhiga mung'olotso? Awu kwasawuli ya chichi ungumubedala mung'olotso? Hetwe tweka tukwima halutalo ha chigoda cha wuhigo cha Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Kwakuva yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">Mutwa anlonga, “Kota hila fyo ntsinkwendelela kikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">chila lifugamilo likufugama halutalo hangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">na chila munu akulonga mwene kuta heni yo ntsili Mulungu.”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Ihyo duve chila munu akihala ndongwa tsake halutalo ha Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lekaje kumwambutsa mung'olotso adite ndongwa ntsibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Ihyo lelo tulekaje kihiga, ila tulamule kuta chila munu alekaje kuva chambutso kwa muyage kudita ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Kwa kihantsa na Mutwa Yesu, ntsin'tsela nachene kuta kuduhuli chilyo chochive chochifuluche chikudite uleche kidichilwa kumufugamila Mulungu. Lechelelo manyi munu awone kuta chilyo chitunga chili ihyo, kwa munu uyo chikuva hihyo. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Manyi mung'olotso asusutale kwasawuli ya chilyo cho unkulya, duve unkuva sinambe ulongotswe na wugano. Walahogola uchidite chilyo cho unkulya chimwambutse mung'olotso yo Chilisito afweye kwasawuli yake ikuvale. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Mulekaje kidichila chinu cho munguchiwona henye kuta chinofu, munu alekaje kuchibedala. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Kwasawuli wuntsajila wa Mulungu siyo kulya na kung'wa ng'ani, ila wuntsajila wa Mulungu wuletaga wuwuya na wusichimafu hamwe na wusangalo wowunletwa na Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Munu yoyuve yo angumutumichila Chilisito chinya ihyo amugan'yaga Mulungu na kudichilwa na vanu.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Ihyo siku tseka tukangalaje kudita ndongwa tso tsinleta wusichimafu na kihongetsa hetwe kwa hetwe. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Walahogola kuyananga katsi ya Mulungu kwasawuli ya kusumwanila chilyo. Kwasawuli filyo fyeka finofu halutalo ha Mulungu, lechelelo yikuva fibi kulya chilyo cho chive cho chifuluche chimwambutse mung'olotso adite ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Yikuva chiba uleche kulya nyama, awu kung'wa difwayi, awu kudita lulongwa loluve lo lufuluche lumwambutse mung'olotso adite ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Ihyo wibatilitse chila cho unguchitumba, uvaje nacho mu numbula yako halutalo ha Mulungu. Akuva na wuhechelelo kwa Mulungu munu yula yo sinambe ahigwe mu numbula yake kwasawuli ya chinu cho an'dita. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Lechelelo manyi munu ave ankulya kuno angiputsaputsa kwasawuli ya chilyo icho cho ankulya, akuva angihiga kwa chila cho ankulya bila litumbilo. Kwakuva chinu chochive cho chin'ditwa bila litumbilo chinkuva ndongwa ntsibi halutalo ha Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Muvatangaje vanu vanji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Hetwe yo tukanje mu litumbilo, tun'ganika kuvatanga vanu vala wo vana litumbilo lidodo ili vadite kota fyo yin'ganika, tulekaje kilava tuvene. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Chila munu an'ganika amugane muyage kwa kumuditila wuwuya, ili nawo vakangale mu litumbilo. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Kwasawuli Chilisito siaditaga ndongwa tsa kumutanga mwene, ila aditaga ndongwa kota fyo gandikwe Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta, “Maligo gawo wo vangukuliga vakanditsile heni.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Kwakuva Mandiko ga Mulungu gandikwe ili kutudahitsa na mandiko igo gatutangaga kihuvila, kutukangatsa na kutuhongetsa mu numbula. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Mulungu yo atuditaga tuhongetswe na kukangatswa, lelo ntsinsuka kuta avaditaje henye muve chinu chimwe kwa kufwata ndongwa tsila tso aditaga Chilisito, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />ili henye nyeka hohamwe kwa litsi limwe, mumutsumitsaje Mulungu yo Dada va Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongwa Nofu kwa vanu veka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Chila munu amudichilaje muyage kwasawuli ya wumelemo wa Mulungu, kota hila Chilisito fyo avadichye henye. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Kwakuva ntsinguvalonjela kuta Chilisito avatumichilwe Vayawudi ili Mulungu alajile wukweli wake, na kukwitsa chila cho avaga alontsile Mulungu kuta akuvaditila vadada vetu, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />na kaha ili vanu wosi Vayawudi vamutsumitse Mulungu kwa lusungu lwake. Kota fyo yandikwe mu mandiko ga Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">“Ihyo ngukutsumitsa heve hagati na gati ha vanu wosi Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">ngwimba ntsumitso tsa litawa lyako.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Kaha mandiko ganlonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">“Henye vanu wosi Vayawudi, muhechelelaje hamwe na vanu va Mulungu.”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Kaha ganlonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">“Henye vanu veka wosi Vayawudi mumutsumilaje Mutwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">henye vanu veka mumutsumilaje Mutwa.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Nambe Isaya yo avaga muloli va Mulungu akalontsile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">“Akutsa munu yumwe kuhuma mu lulelo lwa Yese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">nayo akuvatavala vanu wosi Vayawudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">nawo vakumuhuvila kuta akuvakulusa.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Mulungu yo aletaga lihuvilo avapelaje wusangalo na wusichimafu weka kota hila litumbilo lyenyu fyolili, ili lihuvilo lyenyu lyendelele kuva likomi kwa wuvetso wa Muhe wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chochambutse Pawulo kwandika chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Vang'olotsangu, heni ntsin'tsela kuta mumemile wuwuya weka na ntselo tseka, kaha mufuluche mwidahitse henye kwa henye. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Lechelelo ntsivandichilye ndongwa ntsolofu mu baluva yino bila muloto goguve, ili ntsiviwuse ndongwa nunga. Ndisile ihyo kwajili ya lusungu lo amelye Mulungu, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />lwa heni kuva mutantsi va Chilisito Yesu kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi. Ntsiyikole katsi ya kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu kota mutawula nambiko va Mulungu, ili vanu wosi Vayawudi vave nambiko yo yidichilwe na Mulungu, nambiko yo yihagulwe na Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Ihyo kwa kihantsa na Chilisito Yesu, fuluche sangalile wutantsi wangu kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Singuhogola ndonje chinu chinji chochive kulutila chila cho adisile Chilisito Yesu kukolela kwa heni, ili vanu wosi Vayawudi vamuhulikitse Mulungu. Adisile ihyo kwa ndongwa tsila tso ndontsile na kudita, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />kwa wuvetso wa ndajilo na mitinuso, na kwa wuvetso wa Muhe va Mulungu. Ihyo njentsile luhuma ku Yelusalemu mbaka kula ku Ililiko kuvikula kwa wukwilo Ndongwa Nofu tsa Chilisito. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Ihyo mu numbula yangu ntsinhotsa kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu kono kula ko vang'ali kuhulika ndongwa tsa Chilisito, ili ndeche kubita kuvikula ko mwanga kuvikulwe na munu yunji. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Lechelelo kota Mandiko ga Mulungu fyo ganlonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">“Vala vanu wosi valavikulwa ndongwa tsake vakulola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">nawo vala wo vang'ali kuhulika vakutsela.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo ampanga kubita ku muji gwa Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Ihyo lulongwa ulo lwantsambutse mala ntsongofu ndemwe kutsa kwenyu. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Lechelelo kwasawuli sambi sintsile katsi yangu lubali luno, na kwasawuli mbeye na hamu ya kutsa kwenyu kwa myaka myolofu, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />ntsingihuvila kudita ihyo luvala lo luve luhuma sambi. Honguva mu lujendo kubita ku Sipaniya, ntsingihuvila kuta nguvajendela hala ho nguva mulujendo ulo. Nguva na wusangalo kwa luvala ludodo hamwe na henye, hambele mukunanga kwa lujendo lwangu ulo. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Lechelelo sambi ntsili mung'asi kubita ku Yelusalemu kukola katsi ya Mulungu kwajili ya vanu va Mulungu wo valikuko. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Kwakuva vanu va Chilisito va ku Machedoniya na ku Akaya van'gana vasoje muchango kwajili ya kuvatanga vanu va Chilisito wo vatsunwa wo vali ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Valamwe vene kudita ihyo, kwa wukweli vaganikije kuludita lulongwa ulo kwasawuli ya vanu iwo va ku Yelusalemu. Kwakuva manyi vanu wosi Vayawudi vapasile wuwuya wa chimuhe wa Vayawudi, na vene nawo van'ganika kuvatanga Vayawudi mu wugayu wa finu fya mumivili. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Ihyo lelo ho nguva sintsile katsi yino na kuvapela muchango ugo go gutawulwe kwajili yawo, ngukolela kwenyu ho nguva mulujendo kubita ku Sipaniya. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Ntsin'tsela kuta ho nguva ntsitsitse kwenyu, Chilisito akuvaditila ndongwa tsa wuwuya. <verse eid="ROM 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Lelo vang'olotsangu ntsinguvagongola kwa kukolela kwa Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito na kwa wugano wa Muhe wa Mulungu, mwihantse hamwe na heni kwa kusuchila ndalahela kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Musuchilaje ili vanu wosi vamutumbye Chilisito wo vali ku Wuyawudi valeche kunditila chitika na kaha wutantsi wangu widichilwe na vanu va Mulungu wo vali ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Ihyo manyi Mulungu agane mbetse kufika kwenyu kwa wusangalo, ntsesele hamwe na henye. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Mulungu yo atupelaga wusichimafu avaje hamwe na henye nyeka. Eena!<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Pawulo anguvasamusa vanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Ntsin'gana ntsimutambutse kwenyu muhatsa vetu Foyibe, mutantsi va vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito va Ku Chenichileya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Ntsinguvasuka mumwanuchile kwasawuli atumilwe na Mutwa, kota hila fyo yin'ganika kuvanuchila vanu va Mulungu, mumupele chila chinu cho an'gana kuhuma kwenyu. Kwakuva mwene aveye muwuya kwa vanu wolofu hamwe na heni.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Muvasamusaje Pilisika na Achila wo vatantsi vayangu mu katsi ya Ndongwa Nofu tsa Chilisito Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Vanu iwo wo vavaga chang'ani nambe kufwa kwasawuli ya heni, siyo heni ng'ani yo ntsinguvalumba, ila hamwe na vanu veka wosi Vayawudi wo vamutumbye Chilisito. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Kaha muvasamusaje vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito wo vitang'anaga mukaye yawo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Mumusamusaje na muyangu Epaineto, yo mulongola kumutumba Chilisito uko ku Asiya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Mumusamusaje na Maliya, yo adisile katsi nalamu kwasawuli ya henye. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Muvasamusaje Andiloniko na Yuniya iwo wo vayangu wo vavaga vafuntsilwe hamwe na heni, iwo van'tselanika na vatumi, vene vandongwe kumutumba Chilisito.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Mumusamusaje na muyangu Ampiliyato, yo ntsingumugana kwasawuli ya kihantsa na Mutwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Mumusamusaje Alubano muyangu mu katsi ya Ndongwa Nofu tsa Chilisito, kaha mumusamuse na muyangu Sitakisi. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Mumusamuse Apele, yo alaje kuta amutumbye Chilisito nachene. Kaha muvasamusaje vanu veka wo vali mukaye ya Alisitobulo. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Mumusamuse Muyawudi muyangu Helodiyoni. Kaha muvasamusaje vanu veka wo vali mukaye ya Nalichisi wo vangumutumba Mutwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Muvasamuse Tilifwayina na Tilifwosa, vadala iwo vikangatsaga kukola katsi ya wutantsi kwa Mutwa. Kaha mumusamuse muyangu Pelisisi yo ntsingumugana, mudala uyu nayo adisile ndongwa ntsolofu kwasawuli Mutwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Mumusamuse na Lufwo, munu yo ikangatsaga kukola katsi ya wutantsi kwa Mutwa, mumusamuse hamwe na yuve yo aveye yuvangu. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Muvasamuse Asinichilito na Filegoni, Helime na Patiloba, na Helima hamwe na vanyalukolo veka wovali hamwe nawo. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Muvasamuse Filologo, na Yulia, Neleya na muhatsave, Olimpa na vanu veka va Mulungu wo vali hamwe nawo.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Mwisamusaje henye kwa henye kwa kinonela kota fyo vaditaga vanu veka va Mulungu. Mun'samuswa na vanu veka wo vamutumbye Chilisito.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo ansinda kudahitsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Vang'olotsangu ntsinguvagongola kuta mwiyangalile na vanu wo vankwambutsa vanu vapungane na kuvadita vanu vanji valileche litumbilo, tebe na madahitso go mwadahitswe. Mwiviche kutali nawo. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Kwasawuli vanu kota iwo sinambe vamutumichile Mutwa vetu Chilisito, ila vangisangalatsa vene hela. Kwa ndonga yawo ndeche na ya kugongoletsa, vatsiyatsaga numbula tsa vanu vawuya. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Chila munu ahuliche hila henye fyo muli vanu va kidichila mu Ndongwa Nofu, na heni ntsina wusangalo wukomi kwajili yenyu. Ihyo ntsin'gana muve na ntselo mu ndongwa nofu na mulekaje ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Nayo Mulungu yo chambutso cha wusichimafu, akwangufitsa kulivika Lihoka hasi ha magulu genyu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Lusungu lwa Mutwa vetu Yesu wuvaje hamwe na henye. Eena! <verse eid="ROM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Hihila anguvasamusa Timoseyo, mutantsi muyangu mu katsi ya Chilisito. Nawo Vyawudi vayangu Luchiyo, na Yasoni, na Sosipatulo nawo vanguvasamusa.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Heni Telitiyo yo ntsandiche baluwa yino, ntsinguvasamusa kwa Litawa lya Mutwa.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Anguvasamusa Gayo munyakaye vangu, hamwe na vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito wo vangitang'ana mu kaye yake. Elasito muvika magobole va muji guno, hamwe na munyalukolo vetu Kwalito nawo vanguvasamusa. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Lusungu lwa Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito wuvaje hamwe na henye nyeka. Eena!<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Suko ya kumutsumitsa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Lelo atsumitswe Mulungu, mwene yo amvetsa kuvakangatsa henye mu litumbilo kwa Ndongwa Nofu tsa Yesu Chilisito, fiho yila yo yavaga yifihilwe luhuma katali. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Lechelelo sambi fiho iyo yigubulwe na kutselanika kukolela mandiko ga valoli va Mulungu. Kwa amuli ya Mulungu yo angikala siku tseka tsotsigaya wudugo yiwoniche kwa vanu veka, ili vanu va inyi tseka vamutumbe na kuhulikitsa. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Wuvina wuve na Mulungu yo aliyeka munya ntselo tseka, atsumitswe siku tseka tsotsigaya wudugo kukolela Yesu Chilisito. Eena!<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>